title: Table3A
---
// Talk target of the chair at Samantha's table (Hotspots layer). Her notebook lies on it.
-> Sit down <<if $chapter == "R1Thu1" and $gate_r1_thu1_door and not $gate_r1_thu1_sit>>
    <<next_scene Route1Dinner>>
-> Look at her notebook <<if $chapter == "R1Thu1" and $gate_r1_thu1_door and not $gate_r1_thu1_sit and $r1_dinner_notes == "">>
    <<set $r1_dinner_notes to "peeked">>
    <<done R1Dinner1 peek>>
    <<done R1Dinner1 notes>>
    // PLACEHOLDER lines.
    You: Her notebook. My name's on a page.
    {$samantha_name}: Ah. That's mine. You'll hear it at dinner.
-> Open the wine <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and $item_corkscrew>>
    <<set $item_corkscrew to false>>
    <<set $gate_r1_thu2_open to true>>
    <<done R1Dinner2 open>>
    <<note r1_thu2 "Sit at her table.">>
    You: There.
    {$samantha_name}: Two glasses. Not to the top.
-> Sit down <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and $gate_r1_thu2_shoes and not $gate_r1_thu2_dinner>>
    <<if $gate_r1_thu2_open>>
        <<next_scene Route1Thu2Dinner>>
    <<else>>
        {$samantha_name}: Wine first. Corkscrew. Drawer. Sink.
    <<endif>>
-> Look at her notebook <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and $gate_r1_thu2_shoes and not $gate_r1_thu2_dinner>>
    You: Her notebook. Closed, with a pen clipped to it.
-> Open her notebook <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and $gate_r1_thu2_shoes and not $gate_r1_thu2_dinner and $r1_thu2_notebook == "">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_notebook to "reached">>
    <<done R1Dinner2 notebook>>
    {$samantha_name}: Ah.
    {$samantha_name}: That's mine.
-> Look
    <<if $chapter == "R1Thu1" and $gate_r1_thu1_sit and not $gate_r1_thu1_dishes>>
        {$samantha_name}: Dinner's over. The sink isn't going to come to you.
    <<else>>
        You: Her table. Her notebook on it, closed.
    <<endif>>
===
